  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>40</x>
      <y>1710</y>
      <w>1350</w>
      <h>90</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Each interface is implemented by a JDBC class for PostgreSQL (H2 in PostgreSQL mode in tests):
JdbcProfileRepository, JdbcPantryRepository, JdbcMealPlanRepository, JdbcPlanChangeRepository,
JdbcPlanImpactRepository, JdbcGroceryListRepository, JdbcRecipeRepository, JdbcIngredientRepository.
Database opens connections; DatabaseSetup creates the 13 tables and loads the catalogue (mealiq setup).
bg=#FFFFFF</panel_attributes>
